      <div
        class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 p-6"
      >
        <h3
          class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4"
        >
          How Scores Are Calculated
        </h3>
        <div
          class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-3"
        >
          <p>
            Each indicator is scored from 0-100 based on specific criteria. For example, a title tag is evaluated on length (optimal: 50-60 characters), keyword presence, and uniqueness.
          </p>
          <p>
            Category scores are calculated as the average of their indicator scores. The final score is a weighted sum:
          </p>
          <div
            class="bg-slate-950 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 overflow-x-auto"
          >
            <code>
              Final Score = (Technical × 0.30) + (Content × 0.40) + (Performance × 0.20) + (UX × 0.10)
            </code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
